        <h1>CASE — Conditional Diffusion Transformers for Multi-Asset Scenario Generation and Portfolio Risk Measurement</h1>
        <div class="sub">A generative model learns a distribution and a representation; a market scenario depends on too many factors for an unconditional one to be useful. CASE makes the generator a conditional surrogate — a market twin for one decision — and scores it by the capital it tells a desk to hold.</div>
        <div class="acts">
